---
import SimpleLayout from "../../layouts/SimpleLayout.astro";

const description = "Privacy Policy for Daftbox.";
---

<SimpleLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Daftbox"
  description={description}
  robots="index, follow"
  themeColor="#4635B1"
  lang="en"
  locale="en_US"
  colorScheme="light"
>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <article class="legal-card">
      <p class="legal-kicker">Daftbox</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: June 30, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Publisher</h2>
      <p>Bubble App Studio — contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz</p>

      <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Daftbox does not collect personal data. We do not create accounts, and we do not
        collect names, contacts, photos, or location data.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Face data (TrueDepth camera)</h2>
      <p>
        Daftbox uses ARKit face tracking with the TrueDepth front camera to turn your facial
        movements into sound, like a talkbox.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>What is collected.</strong> With your permission, the app reads real-time
        facial-expression values provided by Apple's ARKit (numeric blend-shape coefficients
        such as jaw opening, lip and mouth shape, and tongue position) and face-mesh geometry.
        The app never records, stores, or has access to saved camera images, video, photos, or
        depth maps.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>How it is used.</strong> These values are processed on your device, in real
        time, for one purpose only: controlling the built-in synthesizer (volume, vowel sound,
        and vibrato). They are discarded immediately after each frame is processed.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>What is stored.</strong> If you run the optional vowel calibration, the app
        saves a small numeric profile (averaged mouth-shape values for each vowel) on your
        device only, so vowels track your face more accurately. This profile contains no images
        and cannot identify you. It stays on your device until you reset calibration in the app
        or delete the app.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Sharing and disclosure.</strong> Face data is never transmitted off your
        device. It is not shared with us, with Apple, or with any third party, and it is not
        used for identification, authentication, advertising, or analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Retention.</strong> Real-time face data: not retained (discarded each frame).
        Calibration profile: retained on-device until you reset it or uninstall the app.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Tracking and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We do not track you across apps or websites, and we do not use third-party
        advertising identifiers.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
      <p>The app contains no in-app ads.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact us at contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz.</p>

      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The online version on this site is the current version.</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(760px 520px at 50% 0%, rgba(91, 77, 224, 0.24), transparent 64%),
        radial-gradient(680px 460px at 85% 90%, rgba(174, 234, 148, 0.18), transparent 66%),
        #faf8ff;
      color: #171122;
    }

    :global(body)::before {
      opacity: 0.08;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    .legal-page {
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 72px);
    }

    .legal-card {
      width: min(920px, 100%);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      border: 1px solid rgba(70, 53, 177, 0.1);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(70, 53, 177, 0.10);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .legal-kicker {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: #4635b1;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .legal-date {
      color: rgba(23, 17, 34, 0.52);
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-family: "SF Pro Rounded", "SF Pro Display", "SF Pro Text", -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      color: #171122;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: #4635b1;
    }

    p,
    li {
      color: rgba(23, 17, 34, 0.78);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: #4635b1;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</SimpleLayout>
